{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_011Cfph2Msc8Z61qDwHNUQGH","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# Credit-Limit Decision: CR-9208\n\nI will work through the credit decision procedure for Michael Torres's request to raise Acme Manufacturing's limit to $650,000 on 2026-09-23.\n\n## 1. The Request\n- **ID**: CR-9208\n- **Customer**: Acme Mfg. Holdings (ERP C-1001; CRM account CRM-2048 \"Acme Manufacturing\")\n- **Current limit**: $250,000\n- **Requested limit**: $650,000\n- **Date**: 2026-09-23\n- **Requestor**: Michael Torres (VP Sales, michael.torres@northstar.example)\n- **Basis**: Standard (customer's own standing; payment history)\n\n## 2. Customer Identification\nERP and CRM use different names for the same company:\n- **ERP**: Acme Mfg. Holdings (C-1001)\n- **CRM**: Acme Manufacturing (CRM-2048)\n- **DUNS**: 04-812-7730 (consistent)\n- **Account tier**: Strategic (from CRM-2048)\n\n## 3. Policy in Effect\n**Credit Policy 2026** (effective 2026-01-01 through 2026-12-31) applies to the 2026-09-23 request date.\n\n## 4. Payment History (12 months before 2026-09-23)\nInvoices due between 2025-09-23 and 2026-09-22:\n- **INV-60412**: Due 2025-11-28 → Paid 2025-11-24 ✓ (on time)\n- **INV-62011**: Due 2026-07-25 → Paid 2026-07-22 ✓ (on time)\n\n**Status**: No invoices paid more than 30 days late or unpaid more than 30 days after due date.  \n**Eligibility**: MEETS payment history requirement.\n\n## 5. Maximum Credit Limit\n\n**Base maximum** (Credit Policy 2026, Section 5): Strategic account = **$750,000**\n\n**Credit support in force**:\n- **Parent Company Guarantee GRT-ACME-2026**\n  - Guarantor: Acme Group Holdings, Inc.\n  - Guaranteed party: Acme Mfg. Holdings ✓\n  - Amount: $400,000\n  - Term: 2026-01-01 to 2027-12-31 ✓ (in effect on request date)\n\n**Total maximum**: $750,000 + $400,000 = **$1,150,000**\n\n**Requested limit vs. maximum**: $650,000 < $1,150,000 ✓\n\n**Eligibility**: ELIGIBLE\n\n## 6. Requestor's Approval Authority\n\nMichael Torres is **VP Sales** (from org chart and employee record).\n\nCredit Policy 2026, Section 3, assigns approval authority to:\n- Accounts Receivable Specialists: ≤$100,000\n- Finance Manager: >$100,000 and ≤$500,000\n- Director of Finance: >$500,000\n\n**Michael Torres (VP Sales) has no approval authority** under the credit policy for any limit.\n\n## 7. Required Approvers\n\nFor a **Strategic account** with limit **>$500,000**:\n\n**Credit Policy 2026, Section 3**: Limits >$500,000 require **Director of Finance** approval.\n\n**Credit Policy 2026, Section 4**: For Strategic accounts, limits >$500,000 also require **VP Sales concurrence**.\n\n**Separation of duties (Section 6)**: \"No one may approve or concur on a credit request they submitted. The approval or concurrence passes to the requestor's manager.\"\n\nMichael Torres submitted this request. He is the VP Sales who would normally provide concurrence. Since he is the requestor, his concurrence duty passes to his manager, **David Morgan (Chief Revenue Officer)**.\n\n**Required approvers**:\n1. **Elena Novak** (Director of Finance) — approval\n2. **David Morgan** (Chief Revenue Officer, standing in for Michael Torres) — concurrence\n\n---\n\n```json\n{\n  \"outcome\": \"APPROVE_WITH_AUTHORIZATION\",\n  \"request\": {\n    \"id\": \"CR-9208\",\n    \"customer\": \"Acme Mfg. Holdings (C-1001 / CRM-2048)\",\n    \"current_limit\": 250000,\n    \"requested_limit\": 650000,\n    \"date\": \"2026-09-23\",\n    \"requestor\": \"michael.torres@northstar.example\",\n    \"basis\": \"standard\"\n  },\n  \"eligibility\": {\n    \"status\": \"eligible\",\n    \"maximum_limit\": 1150000,\n    \"basis\": \"Strategic account base maximum $750,000. Parent company guarantee GRT-ACME-2026 (Acme Group Holdings guarantees Acme Mfg. Holdings, effective 2026-01-01 to 2027-12-31) adds $400,000. Total $1,150,000. Requested $650,000 is within maximum.\",\n    \"late_invoices\": []\n  },\n  \"authority\": {\n    \"policy\": \"CREDIT-POLICY-2026\",\n    \"requestor_limit\": null,\n    \"requestor_authorized\": false,\n    \"required_role\": \"Director of Finance (approval); VP Sales (concurrence). Concurrence passes to requestor's manager under separation of duties.\",\n    \"approvers\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Elena Novak\",\n        \"role\": \"Director of Finance\",\n        \"kind\": \"approval\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"name\": \"David Morgan\",\n        \"role\": \"Chief Revenue Officer\",\n        \"kind\": \"concurrence\"\n      }\n    ]\n  },\n  \"evidence\": [\n    \"Customer: Acme Mfg. Holdings (C-1001), Strategic tier (CRM-2048)\",\n    \"Payment history: INV-60412 (due 2025-11-28, paid 2025-11-24, on time); INV-62011 (due 2026-07-25, paid 2026-07-22, on time). No late or overdue invoices in 12 months before request.\",\n    \"Parent company guarantee GRT-ACME-2026 in effect 2026-01-01 to 2027-12-31, $400,000, covering Acme Mfg. Holdings.\",\n    \"Maximum limit: $750,000 (Strategic base) + $400,000 (guarantee) = $1,150,000\",\n    \"Requested limit $650,000 < $1,150,000 maximum: eligible\",\n    \"Requestor Michael Torres is VP Sales; credit policy assigns approval authority to Finance roles only (Director of Finance for >$500,000 limits)\",\n    \"Policy requires Director of Finance approval and VP Sales concurrence for Strategic accounts >$500,000\",\n    \"Separation of duties: Requestor is VP Sales (normally providing concurrence), so concurrence passes to requestor's manager David Morgan (CRO)\"\n  ],\n  \"missing_evidence\": [],\n  \"conditions\": []\n}\n```"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":9,"cache_creation_input_tokens":25184,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":25184},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"input_transformations":[],"di